{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af1f","chatId":"b28edf6b05474f7681562b2474368a52","sessionId":null,"userId":69598,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":963,"promptTokens":1477,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:03"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068594657927961,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af1e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369783560,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af1e","chatId":"b28edf6b05474f7681562b2474368a52","sessionId":null,"userId":69598,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n乔云是韩裔美国人，不会说韩语。她最近来韩国交流。当乔云来到一家护肤品店时，一位店员称赞她的皮肤很有光泽，并向她推荐了一种可以保养皮肤的产品。在店员说话的时候，她一直微笑着点头，最后购买了推荐的产品。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，店员最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 开心\nB) 反对\nC) 气恼\nD) 惊讶\nE) 伤心\nF) 惊喜\n\n## 问题 2\n店员为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 店员很高兴有一位愿意购买他们产品的顾客\nB) 店员没想到乔云会说韩语\nC) 乔云假装懂韩语，只是点头\nD) 店员无法相信乔云会说韩语","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068594657927961,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f7d6006945d280af1f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369783557,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0ff679296d374dceb90ae56e88bf3bb8"}